<title>PERU: Peru says to issue up to 1.6 bln soles in bonds.</title>
<headline>Peru says to issue up to 1.6 bln soles in bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's Economy Minister Jorge Camet said the government would issue in 1997 up to 1.6 billion soles of bonds on local markets.</p>
</text>
